        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/48274807144475-Multi-Email-Profiles#what-triggers-a-merge",
          "text": "What triggers a merge?"
        },
        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/48274807144475-Multi-Email-Profiles#what-carries-over-when-profiles-merge",
          "text": "What carries over when profiles merge?"
